    "file": "mrbgems/mruby-compiler/core/codegen.c",
    "function": "genjmp2",
    "line": 448,
    "fine_trace_step": 5,
    "variable": "PEEK_S(s->iseq+pos)",
    "missing_conjunct": "PEEK_S(s->iseq+pos) == (pc == JMPLINK_START ? 0 : (uint16_t)((int32_t)pc - (int32_t)(pos + 2)))",
    "criterion": "In the `a > 0xff` `OP_EXT1` branch, after `pos = s->pc`, `genjmp2()` must encode the jump-link field with `gen_jmpdst(s, pc)` semantics instead of storing raw `pc` bits.",
    "description": "The vulnerable branch emits `gen_S(s, pc)` at the placeholder slot, so the saved 16-bit field is raw link-state rather than the relative jump-link encoding that `dispatch()` expects. The fixed program emits the same `OP_EXT1` form but writes the `gen_jmpdst()` encoding at that slot."
  },
